     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: DiagnosticReport diagnosticreport-example-ecg</b></p><a name=\"diagnosticreport-example-ecg\"> </a><a name=\"hcdiagnosticreport-example-ecg\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-diagnosticreport-eu-ecg.html\">DiagnosticReport: ECG Report (EU)</a></p></div><h2><span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 11524-6}\">EKG study</span> (<span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0074 EC}\">Electrocardiac (e.g., EKG,  EEC, Holter)</span>) </h2><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td>Subject</td><td>Maria Rossi  Female, DoB: 1965-04-12 ( http://example.org/fhir/sid/patient-id#ECG-PAT-0001)</td></tr><tr><td>Relevant Time</td><td>2026-10-20 09:30:00+0100</td></tr><tr><td>Reported</td><td>2026-10-20 10:15:00+0100</td></tr><tr><td>Performer</td><td> <a href=\"Practitioner-practitioner-example-ecg.html\">Luca Bianchi (http://example.org/fhir/sid/practitioner-id#CARD-0042)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Identifier</td><td> <code>http://example.org/fhir/sid/ecg-report</code>/RPT-2026-000123</td></tr><tr><td>Presented Form</td><td> application/pdf @ <a href=\"http://example.org/ecg/reports/RPT-2026-000123.pdf\">http://example.org/ecg/reports/RPT-2026-000123.pdf <img src=\"external.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline\"/></a></td></tr></table><p><b>Report Details</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Value</b></td><td><b>Flags</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"Observation-observation-example-ecg-examination.html\"><span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 11524-6}\">EKG study</span></a></td><td>Normal ECG</td><td>Final</td></tr></table><p>Normal sinus rhythm. Normal ECG.</p></div>"
